@startuml agentic-vs-autonomous-organization
title Agentic vs Autonomous Organization Orthogonality ; per ADR-ES-021 section 3 + section 8

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Organization" as O
class "Agentic Organization" as AgO
class "Autonomous Organization" as AutoO
class "Agentic + Autonomous Organization" as BothO

O <|-- AgO : specializes (v1.9.0)
O <|-- AutoO : specializes (v2.0.0)
AgO ..> BothO : compositional future
AutoO ..> BothO : compositional future

note bottom of O
  Per ADR-ES-021 section 3 + section 8:
  - Agentic Organization does NOT imply Autonomous Organization
  - Autonomous Organization does NOT imply Agentic Organization
  - An Organization may be both
  - An Organization may be neither
  - Neither dimension subsumes the other
end note

@enduml
